WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.160
Ieoh Ming Pei was known as the master of modern architecture.
贝聿铭被称为现代建筑大师。

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.540
He designed many famous buildings and landmarks around the world.
他在世界各地设计了许多著名的建筑和地标。

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.130
Pei was born in Guangzhou in 1917.
贝聿铭1917年出生于广州。

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.810
He grew up in a family that valued education and traditional art.
他在一个重视教育和传统艺术的家庭中长大。

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.680
Suzhou was his ancestral hometown.
苏州是他的祖籍地。

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.950
Pei spent most of his childhood holidays there.
贝聿铭童年的大部分假期都是在那里度过的。

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.860
During those holidays, he would visit the gardens whenever he had time.
在那些假期里，每当有空，他就会去游览园林。

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:34.450
Seeing those rocks, stone bridges and waterfalls, he began to show interest in them.
看到那些山石、石桥和瀑布，他开始对这些景物表现出兴趣。

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.770
At the age of ten, Pei moved with his family to Shanghai.
十岁时，贝聿铭随家人搬到了上海。

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:44.030
The city’s international architectural style had a strong influence on him.
这座城市国际化的建筑风格对他产生了很大的影响。

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.790
He decided to become an architect.
他决定成为一名建筑师。

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:50.890
In 1935, Pei went abroad to study.
1935年，贝聿铭出国留学。

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:55.170
When he was 38, he started his company in New York.
38岁时，他在纽约创办了自己的公司。

00:00:55.970 --> 00:01:01.320
In 1983, he won the Pritzker Prize, the highest honor in architecture.
1983年，他获得了普利兹克奖，这是建筑界的最高荣誉。

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:07.410
One of Pei’s most famous works is the glass pyramid in front of the Louvre Museum in Paris.
贝聿铭最著名的作品之一是巴黎卢浮宫前的玻璃金字塔。

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:10.390
It was completed in 1989.
它于1989年建成。

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:14.370
It showed his idea—let light design the buildings.
它体现了他的理念：让光线来设计建筑。

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:20.610
Many people disliked it because it was so different from the traditional architecture at that time.
许多人不喜欢它，因为它与当时的传统建筑太不一样了。

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:25.040
But today, it is one of the most popular places in France.
但如今，它是法国最受欢迎的地方之一。

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:28.330
Suzhou Museum is another work of his.
苏州博物馆是他的另一件作品。

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:32.840
It opened in 2006 and became a must-see place later.
它于2006年开馆，后来成了一个必去的地方。

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:38.100
Pei explained, “It should belong to Suzhou, but also to the world.
贝聿铭解释说：“它应该属于苏州，但也应该属于世界。

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:41.290
It should be traditional, yet modern.”
它应该是传统的，却又是现代的。”

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:44.820
He created over 50 designs during his life.
他一生中创作了50多件设计作品。

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:49.240
Pei passed away in 2019 at the age of 102.
贝聿铭于2019年去世，享年102岁。

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.680
His designs are regarded as gifts to the world.
他的设计作品被视为送给世界的礼物。
